# Navigation Template

Expo SDK 54 Template mit React Navigation (Bottom Tabs + Stack Navigator).

## 🚀 Features

- ✅ Bottom Tab Navigation (Home, Explore, Profile)
- ✅ Stack Navigation für Detail-Screens
- ✅ Dark Theme vorkonfiguriert
- ✅ TypeScript mit strikten Typen
- ✅ @expo/vector-icons integriert

## 📁 Struktur

```
├── App.tsx              # Navigation Setup
├── theme.ts             # Design Tokens
└── src/
    └── screens/
        ├── HomeScreen.tsx
        ├── ExploreScreen.tsx
        ├── ProfileScreen.tsx
        ├── SettingsScreen.tsx
        └── DetailsScreen.tsx
```

## 🏃 Quick Start

```bash
npm install
npm start
```

